  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_41343792667980153m_8723952828445526390gmail-docs-internal-guid-9909bff8-7fff-9dd5-8c4f-d8ef1abb4960&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_41343792667980153m_8723952828445526390gmail-docs-internal-guid-9909bff8-7fff-9dd5-8c4f-d8ef1abb4960&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_41343792667980153m_8723952828445526390gmail-docs-internal-guid-9909bff8-7fff-9dd5-8c4f-d8ef1abb4960&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.38; margin-left: 30pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Details of the following shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the LPA prior to the commencement of the relevant part of the work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 41pt; list-style-type: disc; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 30pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Details of all external materials and fixtures for use in the proposed extension. This should include details of proposed bricks (with a sample) and details of the brick bond and mortar mix.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 30pt;&quot;&gt;Details of all proposed new windows including drawings (elevations at 1:20 and sections/details at 1:5 showing the window and masonry surround) and the proposed material, colour and finish.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 30pt;&quot;&gt;Product details for all new external vents, flues or air bricks (product information, material, size, colour and finish)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 30pt;&quot;&gt;Details of any proposed built in cupboards and joinery in the proposed kitchen and bathroom comprising larger scale plans and internal elevations showing the layout and height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 30pt;&quot;&gt;The work shall be carried out in accordance with the details so approved and shall be maintained as such thereafter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 30pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#222222&quot; face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;REASON: In order to safeguard the character and appearance of the conservation area and the special interest of the listed building.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
